# Exact-byte QC research sources and frozen artifacts (TPR-CR33-003). Their
# builders, bundles and tests hash these working bytes against the committed
# LF blobs, so Git for Windows must check them out as LF even when
# core.autocrlf=true; otherwise every pin refuses on a Windows checkout.
# This is the same lane-scoped pattern as research/target_price_revisions/
# (TPR-CR4-001) and changes no committed blob.
* text eol=lf
